fish-bluespace-hint-off = Press "Enable" once the device is anchored and connected.
fish-bluespace-hint-unanchored = Secure the device with a wrench, then connect the power.
fish-bluespace-hint-no-station = Place the device on a station floor tile.
fish-bluespace-hint-no-power = Check the cable connection and available network power. Probers and suppressors require almost their full requested power.
fish-bluespace-hint-no-server = Link a powered research server on this station.
fish-bluespace-hint-critical = Activate suppressors. Reduce the shared background below 80, then restart the device.
fish-bluespace-hint-blocked = Clear a floor tile 2–3 tiles from the harvester. The batch is waiting to be released.
fish-bluespace-hint-working-harvester = Energy is accumulating for a batch. Partial power makes harvesting slower.
fish-bluespace-hint-working-harvester-overdrive = Overdrive accumulates energy and raises station instability faster. Watch the shared background.
fish-bluespace-hint-working-prober = Points are sent to the linked research server. Watch the shared station background.
fish-bluespace-hint-working-suppressor = The suppressor lowers the station's shared background and continues during an emergency shutdown.
fish-bluespace-effect-prober = Produces research points and raises the shared station background. Multiple probers have diminishing returns.
fish-bluespace-effect-suppressor = Stabilizes the station's bluespace field. After an emergency, the background must drop below 80 before harvesting and research can resume.
fish-bluespace-effect-paused = The effect is paused until the cause above is resolved.
fish-bluespace-energy-value = { $stored } / { $required } MJ · { $percent }%
fish-bluespace-eta-value = Next batch in approximately { $seconds } s at the current power supply.
fish-bluespace-eta-ready = Energy accumulated. Waiting to release the batch.
fish-bluespace-eta-paused = The batch countdown is paused.
fish-bluespace-preview-title = Possible batches: { $count }
fish-bluespace-preview-hint = Each cycle produces one batch from the selected category. Numbers count items or individual units of material.
fish-bluespace-preview-chance = Batch chance: { $chance }%
fish-bluespace-preview-product = { $count } × { $name }
fish-bluespace-help = Connection and safety
fish-bluespace-instructions-harvester = Connect the anchored harvester to a high-voltage cable. Normal mode requests 250 kW; overdrive requests 500 kW. Each batch requires 15 MJ of received energy: about 60 or 30 s at full power. Keep a clear output tile 2–3 tiles away. Overdrive raises the background faster; at high levels local incursions may occur. A critical background shuts down the machine.
fish-bluespace-instructions-prober = Connect this device to the APC network and a powered research server on the same station. It consumes 25 kW and raises the background while generating research. Multiple probers have diminishing returns. A critical background shuts down research probers.
fish-bluespace-instructions-suppressor = Connect this device to the APC network. It consumes 50 kW while lowering the station's background and remains available during an emergency shutdown.
fish-bluespace-warning-source = Bluespace monitoring
fish-bluespace-warning = Bluespace background has reached { $level }. Reduce production or activate suppressors.
fish-bluespace-danger = Dangerous bluespace background: { $level }. Local instability and harvester incursions are possible.
fish-bluespace-critical = Critical bluespace background: { $level }. Research probers and harvesters are shutting down. Use suppressors and reduce the background below 80 before restarting.
